{
  "title": "4th Day",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ \r\nاَللّٰهُمَّ قَوِّنِیْ فِیْهِ عَلٰی اِقَامَۃِ اَمْرِكَ وَ اَذِقْنِیْ فِیْهِ حَلاَوَۃَ ذِكْرِكَ وَ اَوْزِعْنِیْ فِیْهِ لِاَدَآءِ شُكْرِكَ بِكَرَمِكَ وَ احْفَظْنِیْ فِيْهِ بِحِفْطِكَ وَ سِتْرِكَ یَااَبْصَرَ النَّاظِرِیْنَ.\r\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\r\nALLAAHUMMA QAWWENEE FEEHE A’LAA EQAAMATE AMREKA WA AZIQNEE FEEHE HALAAWATA ZIKREKA WA AW-ZE’NEE FEEHE LE-ADAA-E SHUKREKA BEKARAMEKA WAH-FAZNEE FEEHE BE-HIFZEKA WA SITREKA YAA ABSARAN NAAZEREENA.\r\nIn the name of Allah, the Beneficent, the Merciful.\r\nO Allah! In this holy month give me the strength to carry out Your orders. Let me taste, in this month the sweetness of Your remembrance. Encourage me, through Your kindness, to pay thanks to You. Protect me under Your protection and overlooking, in this month, O One! Who is the best Looker (Guard) of all the lookers after (guards)!"
}
